{"1807070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reypunk: An Eye For An Eye", "steam_appid": 1807070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Reypunk</i></strong> is a raypunk scifi <strong>Point-And-Click / Beat'em</strong> Up game that features a unique <strong>turn-based combat</strong> system,   <br>along with <strong>realtime playback</strong>.<br> <br>Take your time, plan your moves, use your environemnt to your advantage - and <strong>kick their </strong>[<i>plural noun</i>]. <br>Hit that playback button and watch your replay!     <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807070/extras/8d5bb0c41a9d09450d8924178ed8b0a6.poster.avif?t=1786682829\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807070/extras/8d5bb0c41a9d09450d8924178ed8b0a6.webm?t=1786682829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807070/extras/8d5bb0c41a9d09450d8924178ed8b0a6.mp4?t=1786682829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You adventure as <strong>Rey</strong>, a surveryer for the Intergalactic DIBS Corporation, along with her trusty EYE sidekick <strong>Roland</strong>! They've recently arrived on a new planet, under corporate instructions. Her mission: Remove any and all potential obstacles for the planet's imminent hostile takeover. But things are never that simple, [<i>noun</i>] hits the fan when the local planetary bigwig gets wind of the operation. <br>Rey must act quickly, and cut off the head of the snake! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reypunk will fully support Steamdeck and Controllers</p></li></ul><ul class=